title: Sojusz Polski Społecznej

@entry
# prose-audit: Grade A — Miller can keep a conventional New Left or deliberately refound it as a welfare-nationalist vehicle; the decision names who supplies the machine, who leaves and which voters become available.
title: Miller asks what the restored machine is for
subtitle: Keep a conventional post-SLD strategy, or turn the captured party toward welfare nationalism and anti-establishment politics.
new-page: true
view-if: sld_populist_entry_pending = 1 and old_left_route_state = "miller_restoration" and miller_restoration_done = 1

= A restoration without a strategy

Miller has the chair, the membership records and the regional secretaries.
That does not answer what the restored apparatus should say to towns where the
factory closed, villages where every public office has retreated, or voters who
regard Warsaw's party class as one self-protecting profession.

The conventional answer is to rebuild **Nowa Lewica** as an experienced social-
democratic party. A darker proposal circulates through the old county offices:
abandon the New Left strategy, absorb the existing social-patriotic tendency
and refound the whole vehicle as **Sojusz Polski Społecznej** — welfare state,
national sovereignty, rural organisation and anger at every metropolitan
elite, closer in method to Samoobrona than to the post-2019 Left.

This is not Paulina Matysiak's developmental association, and no other SLD
baron can launch it. It is Miller's capture of the common party, using the
social-patriot organisation that already exists or would otherwise emerge
later.

- @refound
- @stay_conventional

@refound
title: Have Miller refound the party as Sojusz Polski Społecznej
subtitle: Gain a rural and deindustrialised opening; trigger a progressive exodus and split the labour movement.
on-arrival: {!
function add(name, amount) {
    Q[name] = (Number(Q[name]) || 0) + amount;
}
function transfer(from, share) {
    const amount = Math.max(0, Number(Q[from + "_strength"]) || 0) * share;
    Q[from + "_strength"] = Math.max(
        0,
        (Number(Q[from + "_strength"]) || 0) - amount
    );
    Q.social_patriot_strength =
        (Number(Q.social_patriot_strength) || 0) + amount;
    return amount;
}

Q.sld_populist_entry_done = 1;
Q.miller_restoration_done = 1;
Q.old_left_route_state = "miller_restoration";
Q.sld_populist_entry_pending = 0;
Q.sld_populist_route_active = 1;
Q.sld_populist_orientation = "unsettled";
Q.sld_populist_planned_committee = "left";
Q.sld_populist_alliance_partner = "none";
Q.sld_populist_alliance_state = "orientation pending";
Q.sld_populist_ideology =
    "National welfare-populism · sovereignty and anti-establishment left";
Q.sld_populist_escalation = "unsettled";
Q.sld_populist_settlement_stage = 0;
Q.sld_populist_stage_time = Number(Q.time) || 0;
Q.sld_populist_progressive_settlement = "unsettled";
Q.left_party_name = "Sojusz Polski Społecznej";
Q.social_patriot_party_name = "Sojusz Polski Społecznej";
Q.social_patriot_name = "Sojusz Polski Społecznej tendency";
Q.left_leader = "Leszek Miller";
Q.merger_leader = "Leszek Miller";
Q.social_patriot_leader = "Leszek Miller";
Q.left_dominant_current = "social_patriot";
Q.left_project = "Sojusz Polski Społecznej welfare-nationalist refoundation";
Q.left_leadership_result =
    "Miller refounded the restored SLD apparatus as a social-populist vehicle";
Q.social_patriot_active = 1;
Q.social_patriot_in_left = 1;
Q.social_patriot_party_formed = 0;
Q.social_patriot_launch_pending = 0;
Q.social_patriot_dissent = Math.min(
    22,
    Math.max(8, Number(Q.social_patriot_dissent) || 0)
);
Q.social_patriot_referrals = Math.max(
    6,
    Number(Q.social_patriot_referrals) || 0
);
Q.social_patriot_local_organisation = Math.max(
    24,
    Number(Q.social_patriot_local_organisation) || 0
);
Q.sld_populist_transfer_barons = transfer("barons", 0.52);
Q.sld_populist_transfer_labor = transfer("labor", 0.18);
Q.sld_populist_transfer_pps = transfer("pps", 0.30);

add("barons_dissent", 8);
add("labor_dissent", 10);
add("spring_dissent", 20);
add("progressives_dissent", 24);
add("razem_dissent", 26);
add("pps_dissent", 12);
add("party_unity", -18);
add("public_trust", -5);
add("progressive_credibility", -12);
add("feminist_trust", -10);
add("urban_progressive_support", -9);
add("young_support", -5);
add("union_trust", -5);
add("opzz_cooperation", -3);
add("labor_credibility", -3);
add("workers_support", 5);
add("rural_support", 9);
add("pensioner_support", 6);
add("local_network", 7);
add("media_capacity", 3);
add("left_right_score", 18);
add("left_cultural_position", 16);
add("social_patriot_support", 20);
Q.news_headline =
    "Miller refounds the restored apparatus as Sojusz Polski Społecznej";
!}
go-to: expel_wiosna

@expel_wiosna
on-arrival: caucus_exit_target = "spring"; caucus_exit_mode = "punitive"; sld_populist_settlement_stage = 1; sld_populist_stage_time = time
go-to: poland_caucus_dynamics.resolve_exit

@expel_razem
title: Miller expels Wiosna; Razem refuses his SPS refoundation
subtitle: Complete the organisational rupture before deciding the fate of the progressive current.
new-page: true
view-if: sld_populist_route_active = 1 and sld_populist_settlement_stage = 1 and time >= sld_populist_stage_time + 1
on-arrival: razem_breakaway_protected = 0; caucus_exit_target = "razem"; caucus_exit_mode = "punitive"; sld_populist_settlement_stage = 2; sld_populist_stage_time = time

Miller has stripped the Wiosna organisation of SPS nominations, forcing it to
restore an outside party. Razem's council now rejects his welfare-nationalist
constitution and orders its remaining MPs and organisers into opposition.

- @resolve_razem

@resolve_razem
title: Have Miller expel Razem and recognise its independent party
go-to: poland_caucus_dynamics.resolve_exit

@progressives_settlement
title: Miller decides whether the progressive current may remain
subtitle: Keep a stripped internal minority, or expel it to the democratic-left opposition.
new-page: true
view-if: sld_populist_route_active = 1 and sld_populist_settlement_stage = 2 and time >= sld_populist_stage_time + 1
on-arrival: {!
if (!Q.progressives_in_left) {
    Q.sld_populist_progressive_settlement = "already outside SPS";
    Q.sld_populist_settlement_stage = 3;
    Q.sld_populist_stage_time = Number(Q.time) || 0;
    Q.news_headline =
        "Miller proceeds after the progressive current's earlier departure";
}
!}
go-to: return if sld_populist_settlement_stage = 3

Miller has expelled Wiosna and Razem from the SPS organisation. Their MPs and
registrations survive outside it. He can leave the progressive current as a
small, nomination-poor internal minority, or force it into opposition too.

- @marginalise_progressives
- @expel_progressives

@marginalise_progressives
title: Have Miller strip its nominations but leave a minority inside SPS
subtitle: Retain some urban and parliamentary cover; accept permanent internal dissent.
on-arrival: {!
const strength = Math.max(0, Number(Q.progressives_strength) || 0);
const transfer = strength * 0.70;
Q.progressives_strength = strength - transfer;
Q.social_patriot_strength =
    (Number(Q.social_patriot_strength) || 0) + transfer;
Q.sld_populist_transfer_progressives = transfer;
Q.sld_populist_progressive_settlement = "marginalised inside SPS";
Q.sld_populist_settlement_stage = 3;
Q.sld_populist_stage_time = Number(Q.time) || 0;
Q.progressives_dissent = Math.max(72, Number(Q.progressives_dissent) || 0);
Q.progressives_demand_answered = 1;
Q.progressives_escalation_stage = 3;
Q.progressive_credibility -= 4;
Q.urban_progressive_support -= 3;
Q.party_unity -= 3;
for (const adviser of ["zukowska", "kotula", "gawkowski", "nowicka"]) {
    Q[adviser + "_advisor"] = 0;
}
Q.news_headline =
    "Miller strips the progressive current of nominations but stops short of expulsion";
!}
go-to: return

@expel_progressives
title: Have Miller expel the progressive current with Wiosna and Razem
subtitle: Clarify the SPS capture; strengthen a consolidated democratic-left opposition.
on-arrival: sld_populist_progressive_settlement = "expelled to democratic-left opposition"; caucus_exit_target = "progressives"; caucus_exit_mode = "punitive"; sld_populist_settlement_stage = 3; sld_populist_stage_time = time
go-to: poland_caucus_dynamics.resolve_exit

@consolidate_left
view-if: sld_populist_route_active = 1 and sld_populist_settlement_stage = 3 and time >= sld_populist_stage_time + 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.sld_populist_settlement_stage = 4;
Q.sld_populist_stage_time = Number(Q.time) || 0;
if (Q.razem_party_formed) {
    Q.razem_list_committee = "razem";
    Q.razem_electoral_strategy =
        "Host a democratic-left consolidation against Miller's SPS";
    if (Q.spring_party_formed) {
        Q.spring_joined_razem = 1;
        Q.spring_list_committee = "razem";
        Q.spring_electoral_strategy = "Join the democratic-left Razem list";
        Q.spring_razem_relation = Math.max(
            72,
            Number(Q.spring_razem_relation) || 0
        );
    }
    if (Q.progressives_party_formed) {
        Q.progressives_joined_razem = 1;
        Q.progressives_list_committee = "razem";
        Q.young_left_electoral_strategy =
            "Join the democratic-left Razem list";
        Q.young_left_razem_relation = Math.max(
            74,
            Number(Q.young_left_razem_relation) || 0
        );
    }
    Q.razem_alliance_arithmetic =
        "Shared 5% Razem host list against Miller's SPS; party votes and seats remain separate";
}
Q.news_headline = Q.progressives_party_formed
    ? "Razem, Wiosna and Young Left consolidate electorally against Miller's SPS"
    : "Razem and Wiosna consolidate electorally against Miller's SPS";
!}
go-to: return

@stay_conventional
title: Have Miller keep the restored apparatus in a conventional New Left strategy
subtitle: Preserve coalition access and progressive credibility; leave the social-populist opening to others.
on-arrival: sld_populist_entry_done = 1; sld_populist_entry_pending = 0; sld_populist_route_active = 0; sld_populist_orientation = "declined"; sld_populist_alliance_state = "none"; sld_populist_ideology = "Conventional New Left strategy under restored SLD leadership"; party_unity += 3; barons_dissent -= 4; progressives_dissent -= 2; public_trust += 1; news_headline = "Miller keeps the restored apparatus on a conventional social-democratic course"
go-to: return

@orientation
title: Miller chooses one of three roads out of the old Left
subtitle: A host list buys reach at the price of dependence; independence preserves control and carries the threshold risk.
new-page: true
view-if: sld_populist_route_active = 1 and sld_populist_settlement_stage = 4 and sld_populist_orientation = "unsettled" and time >= sld_populist_stage_time + 1

= The new name needs an electoral answer

Miller can take **Sojusz Polski Społecznej** onto a national list borrowed from
the radical right, trade tactical support for places controlled by PiS, or
build a rural committee around his own name. Neither prospective ally offers
him charity. Each demands a different surrender of candidates and freedom.

- @orient_konf
- @orient_pis
- @orient_independent

@orient_konf
title: Have Miller accept the radical Konfederacja wing's conditions
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. A Konfederacja host list, sovereignty plank and local autonomy; no guaranteed cabinet and no progressive candidates in protected places.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The regional liaison and joint-list negotiation require one resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; sld_populist_orientation = "konfederacja"; sld_populist_stage_time = time; sld_populist_planned_committee = "konf"; sld_populist_alliance_partner = "Konfederacja"; sld_populist_alliance_state = "conditional pact"; social_patriot_list_committee = "konf"; social_patriot_electoral_strategy = "Conditional places on the Konfederacja party list"; konf_relation += 8; rural_support += 5; workers_support += 2; anti_establishment_youth_left_affinity += 5; social_patriot_local_organisation += 5; media_capacity += 4; sld_populist_media_salience += 12; sld_populist_factional_capture += 14; sld_populist_international_isolation += 16; progressive_credibility -= 8; union_trust -= 4; progressives_dissent += 10; razem_dissent += 11; pps_dissent += 6; public_trust -= 3; party_unity -= 5; news_headline = "Miller accepts the radical right's conditions for a conditional Konfederacja pact"
go-to: return

@orient_pis
title: Have Miller trade tactical support for a PiS host-list pact
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. PiS keeps nomination and subsidy control; SPS promises no anti-PiS campaign in exchange for welfare commitments and protected places.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The parliamentary and district negotiation require one resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; sld_populist_orientation = "pis"; sld_populist_stage_time = time; sld_populist_planned_committee = "pis"; sld_populist_alliance_partner = "Prawo i Sprawiedliwość"; sld_populist_alliance_state = "conditional pact"; social_patriot_list_committee = "pis"; social_patriot_electoral_strategy = "Conditional protected places on the PiS party list"; pis_relation += 10; rural_support += 4; pensioner_support += 5; workers_support += 3; social_patriot_local_organisation += 3; sld_populist_media_salience += 7; sld_populist_factional_capture += 8; sld_populist_international_isolation += 9; coalition_blur += 8; progressive_credibility -= 9; urban_progressive_support -= 5; progressives_dissent += 12; razem_dissent += 13; pps_dissent += 5; labor_dissent += 4; party_unity -= 6; news_headline = "Miller offers PiS tactical support for welfare pledges and conditional list places"
go-to: return

@orient_independent
title: Have Miller build an independent Samoobrona-style campaign
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Keep the list and subsidy; organise markets, former industrial towns and county protest committees without a host's protection.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: An independent rural and deindustrialised campaign requires one resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; sld_populist_orientation = "independent"; sld_populist_stage_time = time; sld_populist_planned_committee = "left"; sld_populist_alliance_partner = "none"; sld_populist_alliance_state = "independent"; social_patriot_list_committee = "left"; social_patriot_electoral_strategy = "Independent SPS party list"; rural_support += 8; workers_support += 5; pensioner_support += 3; anti_establishment_youth_left_affinity += 3; local_network += 6; social_patriot_local_organisation += 10; media_capacity += 3; sld_populist_media_salience += 9; sld_populist_factional_capture += 4; progressive_credibility -= 6; urban_progressive_support -= 4; progressives_dissent += 7; razem_dissent += 8; pps_dissent += 3; party_unity -= 3; public_trust += 1; news_headline = "Miller prepares an independent rural and deindustrialised protest campaign"
go-to: return

@escalation
title: Miller decides how far the anger should go
subtitle: Keep welfare populism inside verifiable politics, or turn pandemic grievance and conspiracy into an organising weapon.
new-page: true
view-if: sld_populist_route_active = 1 and sld_populist_settlement_stage = 4 and sld_populist_orientation != "unsettled" and sld_populist_escalation = "unsettled" and time >= sld_populist_stage_time + 1

= A choice the route does not make for us

Local organisers bring stories of closed hospitals, corrupt procurement and
officials who never answer a telephone. Beside those records arrive claims
about vaccines, foreign plots and secret rule by experts. They can be separated
— or fused into one anti-system explanation that will dominate every interview
once Miller repeats it.

- @escalation_reject
- @escalation_conspiracy

@escalation_reject
title: Have Miller reject anti-vaccine conspiracy and attack with evidence
subtitle: Less viral media, more credibility with labour figures, doctors and voters who want material opposition without fantasy.
on-arrival: sld_populist_escalation = "bounded welfare populism"; sld_populist_factional_capture -= 5; sld_populist_international_isolation -= 4; public_trust += 5; union_trust += 4; labor_credibility += 4; health_policy_pressure += 3; pandemic_deaths_pressure -= 2; covid_anti_system_pressure -= 3; media_capacity -= 1; social_patriot_dissent += 2; news_headline = "Miller rejects anti-vaccine conspiracy and attacks documented elite failure"
go-to: return

@escalation_conspiracy
title: Have Miller lead an anti-vaccine conspiratorial mobilisation
subtitle: Immediate salience and anti-system recruitment; severe health, credibility, alliance and international costs.
on-arrival: sld_populist_escalation = "anti-vaccine conspiratorial mobilisation"; vaccination_strategy = "Miller's anti-vaccine sovereignty campaign"; sld_populist_factional_capture += 22; sld_populist_international_isolation += 18; sld_populist_media_salience += 14; covid_anti_system_pressure += 14; pandemic_deaths_pressure += 7; health_policy_pressure -= 8; public_trust -= 10; union_trust -= 7; labor_credibility -= 8; progressive_credibility -= 6; media_capacity += 6; rural_support += 4; anti_establishment_youth_left_affinity += 7; social_patriot_support += 8; progressives_dissent += 7; razem_dissent += 8; pps_dissent += 4; party_unity -= 4; news_headline = "Miller turns vaccine conspiracy and sovereignty grievance into a national campaign"
go-to: return

@list_filing
# prose-audit: Grade A — The earlier orientation reaches an electoral commission only after the prospective host's live relations, ideological acceptance and faction balance are tested; refusal leaves an independent SPS list rather than rewriting the host party.
title: Miller brings his conditional pact to the ballot deadline
subtitle: PiS or Konfederacja can still refuse Miller; he can reject dependence and file alone.
new-page: true
view-if: sld_populist_route_active = 1 and sld_populist_settlement_stage = 4 and sld_populist_orientation != "unsettled" and sld_populist_escalation != "unsettled" and sejm_list_negotiation_done = 0
on-arrival: {!
function finite(value, fallback) {
    return Number.isFinite(Number(value)) ? Number(value) : fallback;
}
const orientation = String(Q.sld_populist_orientation || "independent");
let score = 100;
if (orientation == "konfederacja") {
    score =
        finite(Q.konf_relation, 2) * 0.30 +
        finite(Q.konf_accept_order, 25) * 0.22 +
        (100 - finite(Q.konf_mentzenite_share, 47)) * 0.13 +
        finite(Q.social_patriot_strength, 12) * 0.15 +
        (Q.sld_populist_escalation ==
            "anti-vaccine conspiratorial mobilisation" ? 8 : 0) +
        18;
} else if (orientation == "pis") {
    score =
        finite(Q.pis_relation, 8) * 0.30 +
        finite(Q.pis_accept_social, 42) * 0.22 +
        finite(Q.pis_solidarist_share, 58) * 0.16 +
        finite(Q.social_patriot_strength, 12) * 0.15 +
        16;
}
Q.sld_populist_alliance_offer_score = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(100, Math.round(score))
);
Q.sld_populist_alliance_offer =
    orientation == "independent" || score >= 40 ? 1 : 0;
Q.news_headline = orientation == "independent"
    ? "Miller brings his own SPS committee to the filing deadline"
    : Q.sld_populist_alliance_partner +
        " tests Miller's SPS pact before accepting a shared list";
!}

[? if sld_populist_orientation = "konfederacja": The radical-right federation
reviews the sovereignty plank, its market wing's hostility to SPS welfare
spending, the strength of the nationalist wing and whether Miller can deliver
county organisations. The offer score is **[+ sld_populist_alliance_offer_score
+]/100**; forty is required.?]
[? if sld_populist_orientation = "pis": PiS reviews the welfare bargain,
Miller's reliability, its solidarist wing and whether SPS has enough candidates
to justify protected places. The offer score is **[+
sld_populist_alliance_offer_score +]/100**; forty is required.?]
[? if sld_populist_orientation = "independent": No other party has a veto.
The cost is borne in threshold risk, campaign money and the credibility of an
organisation trying to reach villages it has not contested in years.?]

- @file_konf
- @file_pis
- @file_independent

@file_konf
title: Have Miller sign the Konfederacja host-list pact
subtitle: Konfederacja controls nominations and subsidy; SPS keeps its name, component vote and seats.
view-if: sld_populist_orientation = "konfederacja"
choose-if: sld_populist_alliance_offer = 1
unavailable-subtitle: The radical-right federation refuses: the offer score is below 40.
